# Design System

## Typography (Google Fonts)
- Arabic: `Cairo` or `Tajawal` (RTL headings + body).
- English: `Inter` or `Plus Jakarta Sans` (linguistic / technical UI).
- Use `dir="rtl"` on Arabic wrappers; `dir="ltr"` on English sentences/snippets.

## Color & Depth
- Backgrounds: cream / apricot warmth (`#FFF8EF`, `#FEF3E2`).
- Primary: apricot / soft gold (`#F0A05A`, `#E8893A`) — **no purple/lavender**.
- Accents: amber (`#E4A11B`, `#F5C542`) for highlights.
- Success / error: calm green `#3D9A6A`, soft coral `#E07A5F`.
- Depth: `shadow-sm` / `shadow-md`, `rounded-2xl`, soft borders (`#EDD9BC`).

## Feedback & Motion
- Animations: 200–300ms, ease-out. No harsh jumps.
- Success: soft scale, green confirmation.
- Error: micro-shake, soft coral pulse, encouraging tone.
- Press: `active:scale-95` with border/shadow compression.
- Sound hooks: Web Audio soft tones (tap / correct / error / complete).
- Touch targets: min 48×48px.
